---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Not accepted">
  <h1>Not accepted</h1>
  <p class="dim">
    The submission could not be taken. The usual reasons: a model answer without its full prompt,
    a field over its length limit, more than a few submissions from one place in a short time,
    or the inbox being temporarily unavailable. Nothing was stored.
  </p>
  <p class="ko">제출을 받을 수 없었습니다. 흔한 이유는 프롬프트 없는 모델 답변, 길이 초과, 짧은 시간 내 반복 제출입니다. 아무것도 저장되지 않았습니다.</p>
  <p class="dim"><a href="/submit">Try again</a></p>
</Base>
